## Closing Note

Today's session established the philosophy of the project.

The most important realization was that **the scripting engine is not a configuration file—it is a core subsystem of the application**. From this point forward, MViewer is being designed as an original, educational, open-source project whose primary objective is to provide the fastest possible workflow for scientific image inspection while remaining cleanly architected and easy to understand. I think that's an excellent foundation to build on.
